<h1>Your profile claim was <%= @decision %></h1>

<p>Your request to link “<%= @profile_name %>” to your account was <%= @decision %>.</p>

<% if @decision == "rejected" %>
  <p>Please contact your club or an administrator if you need more information.</p>
<% else %>
  <p>The profile is now linked to your account. Its existing training and assessment history remains attached.</p>
<% end %>
